??/93:
<blockquote>
   Heard about a service in Seattle called "Connected dot com" which 
        gave real internet access for only $30 per month (at 2400baud!!!!)  
        I think my addr was <a href="https://groups.google.com/forum/#!search/hebron.connected.com$20-billboard$20beaty$20-beatty$20-beauty" rel="nofollow" >billb@hebron.connected.com</a>.  Then I noticed that I 
